{"id":"61ec6e0176eee556","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-inner3-condensation-instance.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Condensation Instance","display":"df-zfc-inner3-condensation-instance — ZFC Inner3 Condensation Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-condensation-instance","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-condensation-instance"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-condensation-instance — ZFC Inner3 Condensation Instance","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[58-df-constructible-universe]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-condensation-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-condensation-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-condensation-instance — ZFC Inner3 Condensation Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"58-df-elementary-substructure\">58-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (elementary substructure candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> (constructible levels)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha,L_\\beta\">\\(L_\\alpha,L_\\beta\\)</span> (constructible levels)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> (Mostowski-collapse candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation in the membership language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"58-df-elementary-substructure\">58-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3CondensationInstance}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3CondensationInstance}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}condensation\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcInner3CondensationInstance}_S(X,\\alpha,\\beta,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land X\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}L_\\alpha\\land\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,L_\\beta)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\forall z\\in L_\\beta\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(\\pi(x)=z)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\in y\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}condensation\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcInner3CondensationInstance}_S(X,\\alpha,\\beta,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land X\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}L_\\alpha\\land\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,L_\\beta)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(\\pi(x)=\\pi(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\forall z\\in L_\\beta\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;(\\pi(x)=z)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\in y\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The collapse witness is expanded as a bijective membership isomorphism onto a constructible level; a bare <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> symbol did not identify the preserved relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible-universe","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-constructible-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f1